{
  "_provenance": "Synthetic discovery configs shaped as Tasmota 14, ESPHome 2025 (MQTT), Shelly Gen2 scripts, and Zigbee2MQTT 2.x publish them, with abbreviated keys as each tool emits.",
  "tasmota_switch": {
